ds41 patch (b12x_next only), 2026-11-10: accumulate-into-output top-k sum for the prefill residual fold
(adapter/prefill_moe_fold.py, DSV41_PREFILL_MOE_FOLD). W4A16TopKSumKernel(accumulate_output=True): plain bf16
route-buffer reduction unchanged, then out[i] = bf16(float(out[i]) + float(bf16(sum))) with add.rn.f32 (no ftz);
compile key suffixed only when on; own custom op b12x_next::w4a16_topk_sum_accumulate_launch (the stock op's
schema is unchanged); fused_moe._impl.topk_sum_accumulate() selects it in _launch_dynamic_topk_sum and
b12x_moe_fp4 refuses any other launch path under it before launching anything.
